<title>HONG KONG: Anhui Expressway posts 1st final results.</title>
<headline>Anhui Expressway posts 1st final results.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in million yuan unless stated)</p>
<p>Pro forma</p>
<p>     Shr (RMB cents)	    9.18   vs 6.52</p>
<p>     Net			    90.47  vs 59.67</p>
<p>     Turnover		     164.37 vs 85.47</p>
<p>Period from August 15 to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>     Shr (RMB cents)	    3.66</p>
<p>     Dividend (RMB)	     0.0075</p>
<p>     Net			    40.27</p>
<p>     Turnover		     65.33</p>
<p>    Company name		 Anhui Expressway Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  May 10 to June 10</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   June 18</p>
<p>NOTE - China toll road operator Anhui Expressway was listed on the Stock Exchange on November 13, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
